{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "b462862fd40d21340cbec9f0f718d55a648e6642e3fbb38db42b792c8133d34b", "ja": "ふーふふんふーふーふふふふー♪", "zh": "呼——呼呼呼——呼——呼呼呼呼——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e6c9089c23299eba29e5acb3af577d7dc68ea8451b044b5d87c498b51c984541", "ja": "おはようございます、青羽さん。\nなんだか、うきうきしてますね。", "zh": "早上好，青羽小姐。\n感觉您心情很雀跃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "c3aa9f8b50d98e1e199a34437da1069fc17d43bcb48e2cb8d916f48c6664e90c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございますっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "812b31467f90fa6d155869f76d769086c8de1bd666ceaa83b59641715d42a7a3", "ja": "実は、今度ロコちゃんとデートするんです♪\nそれが、とっても楽しみで！", "zh": "其实，我下次要和ROCO约会呢♪\n真的特别期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ee75b89e73a7de750a79e66defbddf3f9e495cac44da1794fb1de22b6c8ec48", "ja": "なるほど、ロコと……。\nえっ、デート？", "zh": "原来如此，是和ROCO……  \n诶，约会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "537bdabe8882df194dc37f1e6844db54398a87ee8b287feb57d4c3c3cc498783", "ja": "あれっ？　女の子同士で遊びに出かけることを、\nデートって言いませんか？", "zh": "咦？女孩子之间一起出去玩，不也可以叫约会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c682ae9012f694d995075dfb9727c8fc31c1ec8f892fe9d71c7031bb3cdfe536", "ja": "ああ、そうなんですね。\nデート、楽しんできてくださいね！", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。\n约会玩得开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "ad5f89201d23762972533d7b7318f505ed868d85c804e1d9f31cf1b763c2a187", "ja": "はいっ♪　……あ、そうだ。社長さんが、\n地方公演についてお話があるそうですよ。", "zh": "好的♪……啊，对了。据说社长有关于地方公演的事情要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3677c08beb43031d4822c9d4a5a0432e5f25e4bd3ec72ec05649c9ad59445ffd", "ja": "そうですか、ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、事務所に行ってきますね。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢您。\n那我去趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "5383f623e79db340d67e3e25baced643e54e45cd1e1789e9dae86021dce398a8", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃ～い♪\n……よーし、お仕事頑張ろーっと！", "zh": "好——路上小心♪  \n……好！我也要努力工作啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "4a0e9a1d5e2e71e632c35c840400cd5a25959e58ace4276434c0decbb749ef20", "ja": "いいですか社長？　壁ドンっていうのは、\nこうやって壁に手を、ドンとついて……。", "zh": "社长，您听好了吗？所谓壁咚呢，\n就是要像这样把手“咚”地撑在墙上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1012_se", "source_sha256": "fdb236ec2f4f7f5a512553c79d540dbd7a0b71283896090e638250cb66fa1c96", "ja": "ドンッ", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "df15eb56c54e3540e2dcee4d7650041772014c901ca872efcb6a6c9aa3e3e43f", "ja": "高木……俺とつきあえよ！", "zh": "高木……跟我交往吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "cf4bd714a60f886c7b2504ec82ae773869e106c70fdc17f0aa87441916543038", "ja": "お、音無先輩……。", "zh": "哦、音无前辈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ca96e44796070f5c0176b9dbd44cf51b6665612c158233553161b92b309d3ebd", "ja": "ふたりとも、一体、何をしているんですか……？", "zh": "你们两个到底在做什么啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "b648bd233d8ca5d65ac2e3909d5a4c59490ae4dab11d30a0b9b07ecffffa872e", "ja": "おお、君か。いやあ、恥ずかしながら、\n壁ドンとはなんのことなのか知らなくてね。", "zh": "哦，是你啊。哎呀，说来惭愧，我不知道“壁咚”是什么意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "18a334755be889eb8b429efb8783408b70a3b5d66a709f84bb1ffa3015e1e289", "ja": "音無君に壁ドンについて\n教えてもらっていたところなんだよ。", "zh": "我刚才正在向音无请教\n壁咚的相关知识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8d2ff345c8296f94393710dd29f86719860646f89eb0dac5b67ad6e43fababb0", "ja": "はあ、壁ドンですか……。", "zh": "哈，壁咚吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3a0d085c752a9afadec83c701aef546d1cdb7e69d90a2be0e63d9e25737462f", "ja": "ちなみに、この後の展開も考えてたんですよ。\nなんと、高木ちゃんは、音無先輩の告白を断るんです。", "zh": "顺带一提，我还想过接下来的发展呢。\n没想到，高木竟然会拒绝音无前辈的告白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3bd0dea1575f3b86586c6388a4b079fb298d86c415c6b5d83fd2e8895fb7a27", "ja": "そして、ひとり、その場に残された\n音無先輩はこう呟くんです！", "zh": "而独自留在那里的音无前辈，会这样嘀咕道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "3100a700339c9d6a32aa0c2fce4ea784a30477be7856f39852d3e1cae9beaadd", "ja": "『ふっ、俺様の告白を断るなんて、おもしれーやつ\nじゃねえか。ますます気に入ったぜ、高木』……って！", "zh": "“呵，居然拒绝本大爷的告白，真是个有意思的家伙。\n我越来越中意你了，高木。”……这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1e999c9251a4c8d1325a293e041607d7eea38bed37c0dd5bc9ab4fe33be6ecb5", "ja": "なるほど……いいと思います！！", "zh": "原来如此……我觉得很好！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "60f1c0dd383accb1659793158af4951aad94d783c511e62f277f0782ba3162a0", "ja": "ところで、社長。\nまた地方公演を行う予定なんですか？", "zh": "对了，社长。\n又打算举办地方公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "8746bcf77e7e7b159398a7e7b6249244f92a8dc0685067c001ac98c91f03ed5b", "ja": "おおっ、既に聞いていたかね。実はそうなんだ。\n地方公演は今や、看板イベントだからね！", "zh": "哦，已经听说了吗。其实就是这样。\n地方公演如今可是招牌活动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "cf0adcc6a80148fcb53fa7092ee8d856668e16925bf37d16e300d35f05db3383", "ja": "だが、慢心してはいけない。これまで以上の\n地方公演にするという気持ちで、頑張ってほしい！", "zh": "但是，不能因此自满。希望你们抱着要把地方公演办得比以往更好的心情，继续加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8ca52b36d33e1be2d0abbea96e7039e2b447e58ac9002bee86d052a07c3388e4", "ja": "はい！　アイドル達と一緒に、\n地方のファンのために……全力で、頑張ります！", "zh": "好的！我会和偶像们一起，为了当地的粉丝……全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "c28d70efb92555c5e0db999285f5ff0037d7906c9b737641b942ab9117c93e48", "ja": "その意気だ！　今回も新曲を用意してある。\n誰に歌ってもらうか、考えておいてくれたまえ！", "zh": "就是这个干劲！这次也准备好了新歌。\n请提前想好让谁来演唱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "5ae6c9f7afc5a28588b7d0a1584481c4b49793b87f6783c788da9edc98072ac0", "ja": "それにしても……{$P$}さん、\n最近、出張が多くて忙しそうですね。", "zh": "话说回来……{$P$}先生，您最近出差很多，看起来很忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "f5efa70e46577cf2980c75f98b4f931a95bd79a6c96b89ce65d51d51b310eb4c", "ja": "デートをしているヒマもないんじゃないですか？", "zh": "恐怕连约会的时间都没有吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "2ba534093ff2a522539982f412fa8c00052834cf07c9f31fc875a8b5ed9534b0", "ja": "あはは、相手もいませんしね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，而且我也没对象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "47a5a132f4617331f7f022bda92c3a2b6ec31db91ad879b3a1915e1d3a5963e1", "ja": "えっ、今はフリーなんですか……。\nなるほど、なるほど……！", "zh": "欸？您现在是单身吗……。\n原来如此，原来如此……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "0ce569a4ffa04a6fabf7e3a9fb62f3ab246dc1e3254a9c985b2659748ac2baf2", "ja": "（次の地方公演、それに新曲……\nさっそく準備を始めるとしよう！）", "zh": "（下一场地方公演，还有新歌……\n那就马上开始准备吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
